What is Flask? 🐍🌐

Flask is a lightweight Python web framework used to build websites, web applications, and APIs.

Simple definition:

Python + Flask = Create custom web applications.

Flask is popular because it is simple and gives developers flexibility.

========

How Flask Works
User / Browser
       ↓
   Flask App
       ↓
 Python Logic
       ↓
Database / AI / API
       ↓
   Response
       ↓
Web Page / JSON

========

Simple Flask Example

Create a file called app.py:

from flask import Flask


app = Flask(__name__)


@app.route("/")
def home():
    return "Welcome to My College Website!"


if __name__ == "__main__":
    app.run(debug=True)

=========

What happens here?

When you run:

python app.py

Flask starts a local web server.

Then open:

http://127.0.0.1:5000

You will see:

Welcome to My College Website!

